<code>assert \result.containsAll(this) && this.containsAll(\result) && \result.size() == this.size();</code>

This assert statement checks that the cloned set contains all the elements of the original set, the original set contains all the elements of the cloned set, and both sets have the same size, ensuring they are equal.
--------------------
<code>assert this.size() == \result.size() && \forall E e; this.contains(e) <=> ((HashSet<E>) \result).contains(e);</code>
--------------------
<code>assert this.size() == ((HashSet<E>) \result).size() && \forall E e; this.contains(e) <==> ((HashSet<E>) \result).contains(e);</code>
